      "content": "it's just hard to believe that. i worked my whole life to build a reputation, a sense of being someone who is capable and stable. now that's gone. it feels like the only thing i have left to control is how this ends. if i stay, i'm just waiting for the world to see how pathetic i've become. there's no way to \"navigate\" through this kind of ruin, is there? it just feels like the descent is inevitable.",
